cess if you are eligible or invited.","short_summary":"An annual URI awards event recognizing student leaders, employees, and organizational teams.","evidence_claim":"URI Student Involvement calls the Rainville Awards an annual event recognizing URI student leaders, employees, and organizational teams, with dinner, awards, and a slideshow.","source_url":"https://web.uri.edu/studentinvolvement/traditions/","source_title":"Traditions and Events – Student Involvement","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Attendance, nomination, and invitation details should be confirmed for the current year.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"uri-international-welcome-week","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"International Welcome Week & Orientation","title":"Begin with International Welcome Week","subtitle":"URI incoming-international-student tradition","notes":"Use orientation to learn campus resources and community expectations, then attend the sessions that fit your arrival plan as an international or exchange student.","short_summary":"URI’s welcome and orientation programming for incoming international and exchange students.","evidence_claim":"URI lists International Welcome Week & Orientation among its signature traditions and says it serves incoming international students and exchanges as they begin study.","source_url":"https://web.uri.edu/commuter-housing/events/","source_title":"Programs & Events – Commuter Affairs","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Intended for incoming international students and exchange students; confirm current orientation instructions.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"uri-o-week","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Orientation Week (O-Week)",